PhotoEnhancer

A private Android photo enhancement app.

Privacy

- All photo processing happens locally on the Android device.
- Photos are never uploaded to a cloud service or remote server.
- Enhanced photos are stored in private app storage.
- Original photos are never overwritten.
- No internet connection is required for photo enhancement.

Features

- Select a photo from the phone.
- Enhance photos using on-device processing.
- Balanced enhancement is the default.
- Preview enhanced photos before saving.
- Preserve original image dimensions.
- Save enhanced copies privately.

Project status

Development in progress.